Source: xt-wg
Section: net
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Bingchen Gong <gongbingchen@gmail.com>
Build-Depends:
 autoconf,
 automake,
 debhelper-compat (= 13),
 libtool,
 pkgconf,
Standards-Version: 4.7.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://github.com/infinet/xt_wgobfs

Package: xt-wg-modules-_KVERS_
Section: kernel
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Provides:
 xt-wg-modules,
Depends:
 xt-wg-common (>= ${source:Upstream-Version}),
 ${misc:Depends},
Pre-Depends:
 ${misc:Pre-Depends},
Description: xtables WireGuard helpers [kernel module for _KVERS_]
 Consolidated xt_wg.ko kernel module providing the WGOBFS, WGANYCAST
 and WGPTCP iptables targets for WireGuard over hostile or asymmetric
 networks.
 .
 This package contains the kernel module compiled for _KVERS_.  If you
 have built your own kernel you will likely need to rebuild this module
 against it; install xt-wg-source and use module-assistant ("m-a a-i
 xt-wg") to do so.
